{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.6213592020670573,"y":0.091569767356385334,"x":0.17087379694781532,"t":"thing you should remember is that you can't tell if a mushroom is safe to eat by","h":0.01310312978203787,"c":1},{"t":"its smell - some of the most deadly mushrooms have no smell and taste quite","w":0.61553395589192716,"h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.10901162802947262,"c":1,"x":0.17087379865410515},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"y":0.12492211808701548,"x":0.17087378212589177,"c":1,"t":"nice, apparently. Finally, just because deer or squirrels eat a particular mushroom","w":0.64271845499674474},{"h":0.015521811844775302,"c":1,"t":"doesn't mean that you can.","y":0.14008370933371883,"x":0.16880357374047364,"w":0.21972139994303383},{"c":1,"x":0.17087379001397587,"w":0.64466018676757819,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"Of course, mushroom picking is associated with the countryside but if you haven't","y":0.18750000009431345},{"w":0.6368932088216146,"h":0.014641744548286595,"y":0.20342679117326257,"t":"got a car, your local park can be a great place to start. There are usually a range","c":1,"x":0.16893203641249366},{"h":0.016037274298266846,"c":1,"x":0.16893203354426201,"t":"of habitats where mushrooms grow, such as playing fields and wooded areas.","w":0.61747573852539062,"y":0.21947674427995023},{"w":0.60776697794596357,"y":0.23546511598655484,"t":"But you need to be there first thing in the morning, as there's likely be a lot of","x":0.17087379248363996,"h":0.014534884301301454,"c":1},{"w":0.61359222412109382,"y":0.25140186943232812,"c":1,"x":0.16893204318713212,"t":"competition - not just from people but wildlife too. The deer often get the best","h":0.016039990933142012},{"h":0.018424335372782208,"c":1,"y":0.26617738212567277,"x":0.16871560375298761,"w":0.23156547546386719,"t":"mushrooms in my local park."},{"c":1,"t":"If you're a complete beginner, I wouldn't recommend going alone or relying on","w":0.61553395589192705,"y":0.29215116249708406,"h":0.014534884301301454,"x":0.16893205103599285},{"w":0.61941747029622396,"h":0.016028218254493409,"c":1,"t":"photos in a book, even the one I've written! There are some really good phone","x":0.16893204145420326,"y":0.30809968862244752},{"w":0.59805826822916663,"y":0.32398753868927455,"t":"apps for identifying mushrooms, but you can't always rely on getting a good","x":0.16893203084402672,"h":0.016199376947040434,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.16893203009067159,"t":"signal in the middle of a wood. If possible, you should go with a group led by an","y":0.34011627916384013,"w":0.629126230875651,"c":1},{"h":0.01601825666576151,"t":"expert - you'll stay safe and learn a lot that way.","y":0.35607476629346924,"w":0.38252426147460933,"x":0.16893204758793795,"c":1},{"t":"Conservation is a really important consideration and you must follow a few","x":0.16893204219121136,"h":0.014663479409856572,"c":1,"y":0.380685358087134,"w":0.58834950764973959},{"t":"basic rules. You should never pick all the mushrooms in one area - collect only","x":0.16888607998402136,"y":0.39586876963842477,"c":1,"w":0.6272801717122396,"h":0.017176473029306027},{"x":0.1689320496485639,"y":0.41121495331770319,"w":0.60194173177083332,"h":0.017564116385866968,"t":"enough for your own needs. Be very careful that you don't trample on young","c":1},{"x":0.16893203980502941,"t":"mushrooms or other plants. And make sure you don't pick any mushrooms that","y":0.42866043633953121,"w":0.6252427164713541,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1},{"x":0.16893203307009808,"t":"are endangered and protected by law.","y":0.44610591919019749,"h":0.014649895047101569,"c":1,"w":0.30485438028971357},{"x":0.17087377495811476,"y":0.46947040507860227,"w":0.60970876057942713,"c":1,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"There's been a decline in some varieties of wild mushrooms in this part of the"},{"c":1,"t":"country. Restaurants are becoming more interested in locally sourced food like","w":0.6213592020670573,"h":0.016199376947040434,"x":0.16893204946154811,"y":0.48535825552895395},{"h":0.016199376947040434,"t":"wild mushrooms, but the biggest problem is that so many new houses have been","c":1,"x":0.16893202663662521,"y":0.50280373817696944,"w":0.6407767232259115},{"w":0.62524271647135421,"x":0.16893203998986431,"h":0.015988371899566145,"y":0.51744186054954611,"c":1,"t":"built in this area in the last ten years. And more water is being taken from rivers"},{"x":0.16893204319835273,"w":0.61359222412109371,"t":"and reservoirs because of this, and mushroom habitats have been destroyed.","y":0.534883721023933,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1},{"x":0.16893204609878448,"t":"Anyway, a word of advice on storing mushrooms. Collect them in a brown paper","w":0.6330096944173178,"h":0.016003767352237852,"y":0.55813953496979063,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"y":0.57412790706266981,"t":"bag and as soon as you get home, put them in the fridge. They'll be fine for a","x":0.16893204340783419,"w":0.61359222412109371},{"c":1,"x":0.16893203528456335,"w":0.61165049235026037,"y":0.59156976714914278,"t":"couple of days, but it's best to cook them as soon as possible - after washing","h":0.01466076218079182},{"c":1,"y":0.6053420064865076,"t":"them really carefully first, of course.","x":0.16865738040038347,"w":0.29377438863118488,"h":0.019484760605286255},{"c":1,"x":0.16893204263125522,"w":0.64466018676757808,"h":0.017472650997363837,"y":0.63081395336996859,"t":"So everybody knows what a mushroom tastes like, right? Well, you'll be surprised"},{"t":"by the huge variety of wild mushrooms there are. Be adventurous! They're great","h":0.014672535453630009,"w":0.6368932088216146,"x":0.16893203630224113,"c":1,"y":0.64825581366028739},{"t":"in so many dishes - stir fries, risottos, pasta. But just be aware that some people","y":0.66417445463296032,"h":0.014641744548286595,"x":0.16893204416829719,"w":0.63883494059244783,"c":1},{"y":0.68023255784640702,"h":0.014534884301301454,"x":0.16893204764770464,"c":1,"t":"can react badly to certain varieties so it's a good idea not to eat huge quantities","w":0.62718444824218755},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"y":0.69622093031361176,"x":0.16699029164934212,"t":"to begin with.","c":1,"w":0.11262135823567707},{"y":0.71947674445166587,"t":"OK, so now I'm going to show you ...","w":0.29902910868326826,"h":0.017594906697020796,"c":1,"x":0.16893204429914269},{"c":1,"w":0.10298739115397136,"x":0.07374902277439617,"t":"PART 3","y":0.78038795654507298,"h":0.016258970599308142},{"c":1,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","w":0.089320386250813802,"y":0.81246105912484756,"h":0.0087598711530738615,"x":0.07378640871925328},{"x":0.073786408303400372,"t":"YOUNG WOMAN:","c":1,"y":0.86043613698839949,"w":0.11067961374918618,"h":0.011656885949250628},{"w":0.089320386250813816,"c":1,"y":0.90988372064648704,"t":"YOUNG MAN:","x":0.073786408630256511,"h":0.010174419129748924},{"w":0.61165049235026048,"t":"That seminar yesterday on automation and the future of work was really good,","y":0.81090342652662539,"h":0.013224480530925953,"c":1,"x":0.20194174401779585},{"y":0.82703488342781428,"t":"wasn't it? Looking at the first industrial revolution in Britain in the 19th century","w":0.60970876057942713,"x":0.19805824096929048,"h":0.014534884301301454,"c":1},{"h":0.016020973894826374,"c":1,"y":0.84299065391209116,"t":"and seeing how people reacted to massive change was a real eye-opener.","x":0.19805825577100403,"w":0.58834950764973959},{"h":0.013214518942194164,"c":1,"t":"Yes. It was interesting to hear how people felt about automation then and","y":0.85887850439386026,"x":0.1980582416945153,"w":0.57864079793294265},{"y":0.87399075355911138,"t":"what challenges they faced. I didn't know that first started with workers in the","x":0.19798297315774713,"h":0.017699981404242116,"w":0.60792607625325523,"c":1},{"x":0.19561484019513589,"w":0.12342121124267577,"y":0.89023972631294279,"h":0.017165100240261855,"t":"textile industry.","c":1},{"w":0.57864079793294265,"t":"With those protesting workers called the Luddites destroying their knitting","y":0.90841121522711477,"c":1,"h":0.014641744548286595,"x":0.19805824170976924},{"c":1,"w":0.50705230712890625,"x":0.19794080215131735,"y":0.92191171304187935,"h":0.019088528832171159,"t":"machines because they were so worried about losing their jobs."},{"h":0.015578583096418019,"t":"Test 3","c":1,"y":0.04162931307773432,"x":0.84638327699889748,"w":0.060631504058837882},{"x":0.83689320538816481,"w":0.066019414265950593,"c":1,"y":0.12354651152389784,"h":0.013081395514657479,"t":"Q13\/14"},{"x":0.83689320450165605,"w":0.036893202463785801,"y":0.23546511615982246,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"t":"Q15"},{"x":0.83495145683625105,"t":"Q16","y":0.34011627895051999,"c":1,"w":0.040776697794596362,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.014534883112922392,"x":0.83689320472927209,"t":"Q17","c":1,"y":0.39534883736795745},{"c":1,"y":0.57412790723799856,"t":"Q19","w":0.038834950129191137,"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.83495145688286299},{"t":"111","x":0.86990291328042135,"w":0.034951454798380466,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"y":0.95930232545760585}],"h":3209}